[00:00.00] 作词 : 张守望
[00:00.60] 作曲 : 张守望
[00:01.20]
[00:29.90]When I walk in the shadow of the day
[00:36.83]She will move in seven different ways
[00:44.16]She remembers what I used to say
[00:52.40]I remember nothing but her shadow
[00:58.93]She will wait
[01:06.32]She will they say
[01:13.76]She will wait
[01:21.31]I remember nothing but her shadow
[01:38.49]
[01:58.32]When I walk alone during the night
[02:05.31]She is waiting and waiting all the time
[02:12.83]She remembers that the world was bright
[02:20.19]I remember nothing but her shadow
[02:27.50]She will wait
[02:35.00]She will they say
[02:42.31]She will wait
[02:49.81]I remember nothing but her shadow
[03:05.10]
